Undervoltage Threshold (LUVT)
.IP "NVME_VOLTAGE_MEASUREMENT_LVOLT_LUVT_MASK" 12
Mask to get LUVT
.IP "NVME_VOLTAGE_MEASUREMENT_LVOLT_LOVT_SHIFT" 12
